  "name": "Room and thread creation and updates",
  "description": "createRoom sends room_set with only the fields it sets (a thread adds parent_room_id and a bare intro_message); updateRoom sends room_set resubmitting title, a bare intro_message, and ext from the latest record, never parent_room_id. Created rooms arrive as room_update joined, edits as updated, and both replace the record in full; a described top-level room is created, posted in, then updated, and a room in left leaves the visible set.",
